The lowest-order amplitude is consequently not one graph but the sum of the two: $\begin{aligned}
\mathcal{A}^{(2)}
&=
\mathcal{A}_{\mathrm{absorb\ then\ emit}}
+\mathcal{A}_{\mathrm{emit\ then\ absorb}},\\
\mathcal{A}^{(2)}&\propto e^2.
\end{aligned}$

